    "overview": {
      "en": "In September 2024, Volkswagen of America launched a generative AI virtual assistant inside the myVW mobile app through a partnership with Google Cloud. Powered by Gemini models on Vertex AI, the assistant combines VW's connected car data with owners' manuals, FAQs, help articles, and official YouTube videos. Atlas and Atlas Cross Sport owners can ask natural-language questions like 'How do I change a flat tire?' and even point their smartphone camera at the dashboard to get multimodal guidance on indicator lights.",
      "zh": "2024 年 9 月，Volkswagen of America 透過與 Google Cloud 的合作，在 myVW 行動應用程式中推出生成式 AI 虛擬助理。該助理以 Vertex AI 上的 Gemini 模型驅動，整合了 VW 的聯網汽車資料、車主手冊、常見問題、說明文章及官方 YouTube 影片。Atlas 與 Atlas Cross Sport 車主可以自然語言提問，例如「如何換備胎？」，甚至可以將智慧型手機相機對準儀表板，獲得關於警示燈的多模態指引。"
    },
