    "summary": {
      "en": "Renault's EV software subsidiary Ampere uses Gemini Code Assist Enterprise to accelerate Android Automotive development.",
      "zh": "雷諾集團旗下電動車軟體子公司 Ampere 使用 Gemini Code Assist Enterprise 加速 Android Automotive 開發。"
    },
    "overview": {
      "en": "Renault Group's Ampere, an EV and software subsidiary created in 2023, adopted Gemini Code Assist Enterprise — an AI coding tool tuned to understand a company's specific codebase, standards, and conventions. Using retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) over Ampere's private codebases, the tool provides accurate code suggestions aligned to Android development standards, explains complex functions, summarizes modules, and helps automate boilerplate code. Ampere also leverages Google Cloud Workstations and virtual twins of Android Automotive OS vehicles for scalable development.",
      "zh": "雷諾集團旗下於 2023 年成立的電動車與軟體子公司 Ampere，採用 Gemini Code Assist Enterprise——一款能理解企業特定程式碼庫、標準與慣例的 AI 程式撰寫工具。該工具利用針對 Ampere 私有程式碼庫的檢索增強生成（RAG）技術，提供符合 Android 開發標準的精準程式碼建議、解釋複雜函式、摘要模組，並協助自動化樣板程式碼。Ampere 同時利用 Google Cloud Workstations 與 Android Automotive OS 車輛的虛擬雙胞胎進行可擴展的開發工作。"
    },
