      "en": "Provenbase has built its talent recruitment tool for businesses on Google Cloud, powering its transformative Deep Search feature using Google Cloud AI. Deep Search avoids visibility bias and taps into non-traditional talent sources—including research publications, patent filings, open-source contributions, and conference proceedings—surfacing candidates who are invisible to conventional recruiting tools. The platform has attracted major corporate clients since its launch in June 2025.",
      "zh": "Provenbase 在 Google Cloud 上建立了企業人才招募工具，並使用 Google Cloud AI 驅動其革命性的 Deep Search 功能。Deep Search 避免了可見性偏見，挖掘非傳統人才來源——包括研究出版物、專利申請、開源貢獻和會議論文——找出傳統招募工具無法發現的候選人。平台自 2025 年 6 月推出以來，已吸引多家大型企業客戶。"
