    "id": "financial-services-customer-revolut",
    "industry": "financial-services",
    "agentType": "customer",
    "company": "Revolut",
    "isNew": true,
    "summary": {
      "en": "Revolut became one of the first EU payment methods compatible with Google's AP2, enabling Revolut Pay in AI-assisted commerce.",
      "zh": "Revolut 成為首批相容 Google AP2 協議的歐盟支付方式之一，使 Revolut Pay 能在 AI 輔助商務中運作。"
    },
    "overview": {
      "en": "Revolut, a global financial services company, became one of the first EU payment methods compatible with Google's Agent Payments Protocol (AP2), launched in September 2025. AP2 is an open protocol enabling secure, consent-based payments within AI-powered conversational environments. By integrating Revolut Pay with AP2, Revolut positions its payment infrastructure to work across agentic AI commerce platforms in the UK and EEA, joining over 60 industry partners including American Express, PayPal, and Mastercard.",
      "zh": "Revolut 是一家全球金融服務公司，成為首批相容 Google 代理支付協議（AP2）的歐盟支付方式之一，AP2 於 2025 年 9 月推出。AP2 是一個開放協議，支援在 AI 驅動的對話式環境中進行安全、基於同意的支付。透過將 Revolut Pay 與 AP2 整合，Revolut 將其支付基礎架構定位為英國和歐洲經濟區代理 AI 商務平台的核心支付通道，加入了包括 American Express、PayPal 和 Mastercard 在內的逾 60 個行業夥伴。"
    },
    "highlights": {
      "en": [
        "One of the first EU payment methods compatible with Google's Agent Payments Protocol (AP2), launched September 2025.",
        "Contributed directly to Google's AP2 open protocol by adapting flows specifically for account-to-account payments.",
        "Revolut Pay enables frictionless one-tap checkout for consumers and merchants across UK and EEA.",
        "Joins 60+ AP2 partners including American Express, PayPal, and Mastercard.",
        "Positions Revolut Pay as the payment rail for AI-assisted transactions in conversational commerce."
      ],
      "zh": [
        "首批相容 Google 代理支付協議（AP2）的歐盟支付方式之一，AP2 於 2025 年 9 月推出。",
        "針對帳戶對帳戶支付調整流程，直接貢獻於 Google AP2 開放協議。",
        "Revolut Pay 為英國和歐洲經濟區消費者與商戶提供無摩擦一鍵結帳。",
        "加入包括 American Express、PayPal 和 Mastercard 在內的逾 60 個 AP2 合作夥伴。",
        "將 Revolut Pay 定位為對話式商務中 AI 輔助交易的核心支付通道。"
      ]
    },
