      "en": "Mystifly, a Singapore-based travel tech company, developed Mystic — a chatbot built on Google Cloud's conversational and generative AI platforms. Mystic offers self-serve options that reduce the need for direct agent support, improving efficiency and customer satisfaction. The solution enables Mystifly to scale customer service without proportionally growing headcount.",
