      "en": "Perfect Memory is a third-generation MAM (Media Asset Management) and DAM (Digital Asset Management) platform that helps customers transform traditional storage into a context-aware knowledge engine. The platform uses AI to understand relationships between athletes, historical events, and emotional nuances in sports and media content, transforming massive archives into an intelligent library. By detecting emotion, text, and contextual meaning from audio, video, and text, Perfect Memory enables creative teams to instantly surface the perfect content for any story — going far beyond basic metadata tags. The platform natively integrates with Google Cloud cold storage and leverages custom and pre-trained AI models.",
      "zh": "Perfect Memory 是第三代 MAM（媒體資產管理）與 DAM（數位資產管理）平台，協助客戶將傳統儲存轉化為情境感知知識引擎。平台透過 AI 理解運動員、歷史事件和媒體內容中情感細微差異之間的關聯性，將龐大檔案庫轉化為智能圖書館。透過從音訊、影片和文字中偵測情感、文字和情境含義，Perfect Memory 讓創意團隊能即時找到任何故事的完美內容——遠超基本元資料標籤的範疇。平台原生整合 Google Cloud 冷儲存並運用自訂及預訓練 AI 模型。"
