    "isNew": false,
    "summary": {
      "en": "mRelief's SMS-accessible AI chatbot simplifies SNAP food assistance enrollment, cutting application time from 90 minutes to under 15.",
      "zh": "mRelief 透過 SMS 可存取的 AI 聊天機器人，將 SNAP 補助申請時間從 90 分鐘縮短至 15 分鐘以內。"
    },
    "overview": {
      "en": "mRelief is a nonprofit that has built an AI-powered SMS chatbot and web application to simplify SNAP (food assistance) enrollment in all 53 U.S. states and territories. Partnering with Google.org and GitLab Foundation, the organization developed an AI assistant called Johnnie that guides applicants through eligibility screening and application submission. The simplified process takes around 2–3 minutes for screening and 13 minutes for the application, compared to the standard 17-page form or 90-minute phone call.",
      "zh": "mRelief 是一家非營利組織，建立了 AI 驅動的簡訊聊天機器人和網頁應用程式，簡化美國全部 53 個州和領地的 SNAP（食物補助）申請流程。與 Google.org 和 GitLab Foundation 合作，該組織開發了名為 Johnnie 的 AI 助理，引導申請者完成資格審查和申請提交。簡化流程的審查約需 2-3 分鐘，申請約需 13 分鐘，對比標準的 17 頁表格或 90 分鐘電話申請。"
    },
    "highlights": {
      "en": [
        "Supported over 2.7 million people and unlocked over $1 billion in SNAP benefits.",
        "Simplified applications are approved at a 70% rate, vs. 58% without mRelief's support.",
        "SNAP eligibility screening takes just over 2 minutes; full simplified application takes about 13 minutes.",
        "AI document-checking model improves photo submission quality and increases first-try application completion by 20%.",
        "SMS-accessible design ensures reach for users without smartphones or data plans."
      ],
      "zh": [
        "已協助超過 270 萬人，解鎖逾 10 億美元的 SNAP 補助金。",
        "透過 mRelief 的簡化申請核准率達 70%，未使用時僅 58%。",
        "SNAP 資格審查僅需約 2 分鐘；完整簡化申請約需 13 分鐘。",
        "AI 文件檢核模型提升照片提交品質，首次申請完成率提高 20%。",
        "簡訊可存取設計確保沒有智慧型手機或流量方案的用戶也能使用。"
      ]
    },
