    "agentType": "creative",
    "company": "Bethel China",
    "isNew": false,
    "summary": {
      "en": "Bethel China and Google built VisAid Learn, cutting teaching video production from days to 5 minutes for 2,000+ visually impaired children.",
      "zh": "Bethel China 與 Google 合作開發 VisAid Learn，將視障兒童教學影片的製作時間從數天縮短至約 5 分鐘，服務逾 2,000 名視障兒童。"
    },
    "overview": {
      "en": "Bethel China is a nonprofit providing education for visually impaired children in China. Working with Google volunteers, they developed VisAid Learn — a platform using Gemini, Imagen, Text-to-Speech, and MediaPipe to automatically generate teaching videos optimized for children with limited vision. Gemini generates scripts, Imagen creates visually optimized images, MediaPipe separates objects with high-contrast outlines, and TTS adds narration. The platform cuts production time from days to about 5 minutes per video and will expand to assist over 2,000 visually impaired children across 15 schools in China and institutions in India, the Philippines, and Malaysia.",
      "zh": "Bethel China 是一家為中國視障兒童提供教育的非營利組織。與 Google 志工合作開發了 VisAid Learn——一個使用 Gemini、Imagen、Text-to-Speech 和 MediaPipe 自動生成專為視力有限兒童優化的教學影片平台。Gemini 生成腳本文字，Imagen 建立視覺優化圖像，MediaPipe 以高對比輪廓分離物件，Text-to-Speech 添加旁白。該平台將影片製作時間從數天縮短至約 5 分鐘，並將擴展至中國 15 所學校及印度、菲律賓、馬來西亞的機構，服務逾 2,000 名視障兒童。"
    },
    "highlights": {
      "en": [
        "Teaching video production time cut from days to approximately 5 minutes per video.",
        "Platform uses Gemini (scripts), Imagen (images), MediaPipe (object separation), and Text-to-Speech.",
        "Will serve over 2,000 visually impaired children across 15 schools in China.",
        "Planned international expansion to India, the Philippines, and Malaysia."
      ],
      "zh": [
        "教學影片製作時間從數天縮短至每部約 5 分鐘。",
        "平台使用 Gemini（腳本）、Imagen（圖像）、MediaPipe（物件分離）和 Text-to-Speech。",
        "將服務中國 15 所學校逾 2,000 名視障兒童。",
        "計畫向印度、菲律賓和馬來西亞擴展。"
      ]
    },
