    "summary": {
      "en": "FIFCO used Vertex AI to classify 36,000 confiscated marine shells with 90%+ accuracy, returning 450+ kg to Costa Rica's ecosystems.",
      "zh": "FIFCO 運用 Vertex AI 以超過 90% 的準確率分類 36,000 個沒收貝殼，協助將逾 450 公斤歸還哥斯大黎加海洋生態系。"
    },
    "overview": {
      "en": "Costa Rican beverage and food company FIFCO launched the 'Back Home' initiative, partnering with the Ministry of Environment and Energy, AERIS, and the University of Costa Rica to use Vertex AI for classifying confiscated marine shells by ecosystem of origin. The AI model was trained on over 18,500 photographs covering 525 different species and distinguishes between Caribbean and Pacific shells. The model achieved over 90% accuracy and has enabled the return of more than 36,000 shells — weighing over 450 kilograms — to their native marine habitats.",
      "zh": "哥斯大黎加飲料與食品公司 FIFCO 發起「Back Home」計畫，與環境能源部、AERIS 及哥斯大黎加大學合作，利用 Vertex AI 依原生生態系分類沒收的海洋貝殼。AI 模型以超過 18,500 張涵蓋 525 種物種的照片訓練而成，能有效區分加勒比海與太平洋的貝殼。模型達到逾 90% 的準確率，已使超過 36,000 個（重逾 450 公斤）貝殼成功回歸其原生海洋棲地。"
    },
    "highlights": {
      "en": [
        "Trained an AI model on 18,500+ photographs of 525 shell species to classify shells by ecosystem of origin.",
        "Classified 36,000 confiscated shells with over 90% accuracy, enabling proper repatriation.",
        "Returned over 450 kilograms of shells to Costa Rica's Caribbean and Pacific marine ecosystems.",
        "Open-sourced the model on Hugging Face, enabling other countries to build their own shell classification systems."
      ],
      "zh": [
        "以超過 18,500 張涵蓋 525 種貝殼物種的照片訓練 AI 模型，依原生生態系進行分類。",
        "以逾 90% 的準確率分類 36,000 個沒收貝殼，實現精準歸還。",
        "將逾 450 公斤貝殼歸還哥斯大黎加加勒比海與太平洋海洋生態系。",
        "將模型在 Hugging Face 開源，讓其他國家能建立自己的貝殼分類系統。"
      ]
    },
    "technologies": [
      "Vertex AI",
      "Google Cloud"
    ],
