      "en": "McDonald's entered a multi-year strategic partnership with Google Cloud in December 2023, deploying Google Distributed Cloud edge appliances across thousands of restaurants worldwide. This infrastructure enables real-time AI applications on-site, sharpening equipment performance insights, reducing operational disruptions, and allowing crew members to focus on customer experience. A dedicated Google Cloud team works alongside McDonald's Speedee Labs innovation center in Chicago to co-develop generative AI solutions for key business priorities.",
      "zh": "McDonald's 於 2023 年 12 月與 Google Cloud 簽訂多年策略合作協議，在全球數千家餐廳部署 Google Distributed Cloud 邊緣設備。此基礎架構支援現場即時 AI 應用，提升設備效能洞察、減少營運中斷，並讓員工更專注於顧客服務。Google Cloud 專屬團隊與 McDonald's 芝加哥創新中心 Speedee Labs 並肩合作，共同開發生成式 AI 解決方案。"
