    "company": "Mercado Libre",
    "isNew": false,
    "summary": {
      "en": "Mercado Libre uses Vertex AI Vector Search and embeddings to deliver precise, semantically relevant search results for online shoppers.",
      "zh": "Mercado Libre 採用 Vertex AI Vector Search 與向量嵌入，為網路購物者提供語意精準的搜尋結果。"
    },
    "overview": {
      "en": "Mercado Libre, Latin America's largest e-commerce marketplace, deployed Vertex AI Vector Search and embeddings to address the limitations of traditional keyword-based search. The system generates vector embeddings for each product in the catalog, capturing semantic meaning and placing similar items closer together in high-dimensional space. This enables shoppers to get precise results even for complex, contextual queries that constitute roughly half of all search traffic.",
      "zh": "Mercado Libre 是拉丁美洲最大的電商平台，部署 Vertex AI Vector Search 與向量嵌入技術，突破傳統關鍵字搜尋的限制。系統為每項商品生成向量嵌入，在高維空間中捕捉語意關係，使語意相近的商品彼此靠近。這讓約佔總搜尋流量一半的複雜情境查詢也能獲得精準結果。"
    },
    "highlights": {
      "en": [
        "Deployed Vertex AI Vector Search to handle complex, contextual search queries that represent ~50% of all search traffic.",
        "Product embeddings capture semantic meaning, enabling similarity search beyond exact keyword matching.",
        "Improved click-through and conversion rates for complex queries following implementation.",
        "Sr. Engineering Manager Nicolas Presta: 'Most of our successful sales start with a search, so it is important that we give precise results that best match a user's query.'"
      ],
      "zh": [
        "部署 Vertex AI Vector Search 處理約佔總流量 50% 的複雜情境搜尋查詢。",
        "商品向量嵌入捕捉語意關係，超越純關鍵字比對的搜尋能力。",
        "導入後，複雜查詢的點擊率與轉換率均有所提升。",
        "資深工程總監 Nicolas Presta：「大多數成功銷售都始於搜尋，提供最符合用戶查詢的精準結果至關重要。」"
      ]
    },
