    "id": "technology-customer-flockx",
    "industry": "technology",
    "agentType": "customer",
    "company": "Flockx",
    "isNew": false,
    "summary": {
      "en": "Flockx uses collaborative AI agents on Google Cloud and Elastic to connect people with local events and combat loneliness.",
      "zh": "Flockx 在 Google Cloud 與 Elastic 上使用協作式 AI 代理人，連結人們與在地活動，對抗孤獨感。"
    },
    "overview": {
      "en": "Flockx is a Michigan-based startup that combats the loneliness epidemic by connecting individuals with local events, communities, and like-minded people using collaborative AI agent technology built on Google Cloud and Elastic. The AI Sidekick feature helps users discover their local 'flock' and engage in real-world social activities rather than staying glued to screens. Flockx uses semantic search and Elasticsearch for highly personalized matching, with Neo4j for data graph analysis and Fetch.ai for inter-agent connectivity.",
      "zh": "Flockx 是一家總部位於密西根的新創公司，透過建構於 Google Cloud 與 Elastic 上的協作式 AI 代理人技術，連結個人與在地活動、社群及志同道合的人，以對抗孤獨流行病。AI Sidekick 功能幫助用戶發現本地「族群」並參與真實世界的社交活動，而非沉浸於螢幕。Flockx 使用語義搜尋與 Elasticsearch 實現高度個人化匹配，並以 Neo4j 進行資料圖分析、Fetch.ai 實現代理人間的連結。"
    },
    "highlights": {
      "en": [
        "Uses collaborative AI agent technology to connect users with local events and communities.",
        "Built on Google Cloud for affordable, scalable infrastructure after migrating from a previous cloud provider.",
        "Powered by Elastic's semantic search, keyword search, and fuzzy matching for personalized user experiences.",
        "Integrates Neo4j for graph data analysis and Fetch.ai for connecting community AI agents to other agents.",
        "Addresses the loneliness epidemic by encouraging offline, real-world human connection."
      ],
      "zh": [
        "使用協作式 AI 代理人技術將用戶與在地活動和社群連結。",
        "從舊有雲端服務商遷移後，建置於 Google Cloud 上，享有更具成本效益的可擴展基礎架構。",
        "由 Elastic 的語義搜尋、關鍵字搜尋與模糊匹配驅動，提供高度個人化的用戶體驗。",
        "整合 Neo4j 進行圖形資料分析，並以 Fetch.ai 連結社群 AI 代理人與其他代理人。",
        "透過鼓勵線下、真實世界的人際連結，應對孤獨流行病。"
      ]
    },
    "technologies": [
      "Google Cloud",
      "Elastic",
      "Vertex AI"
    ],
