    "id": "technology-customer-hand-talk",
    "industry": "technology",
    "agentType": "customer",
    "company": "Hand Talk",
    "isNew": false,
    "summary": {
      "en": "Hand Talk uses AI to translate spoken and written Portuguese into Brazilian sign language via a 3D avatar named Hugo.",
      "zh": "Hand Talk 使用 AI 透過 3D 虛擬角色 Hugo 將葡萄牙語口語和書面語翻譯成巴西手語（Libras）。"
    },
    "overview": {
      "en": "Hand Talk is a Brazilian accessibility technology company that uses AI to automatically translate spoken and written Portuguese into Brazilian Sign Language (Libras) using a friendly 3D avatar named Hugo. The system first converts oral language into ASL gloss (a written representation of sign language), then animates Hugo to perform the corresponding signs. This technology enables communication and education access for deaf individuals and their families. Hand Talk was selected as one of 20 global organizations to receive a share of Google.org's $25M AI Impact Challenge grant in 2019.",
      "zh": "Hand Talk 是一家巴西無障礙科技公司，利用 AI 透過友善的 3D 虛擬角色 Hugo，自動將葡萄牙語口語和書面語翻譯成巴西手語（Libras）。系統先將口語轉換為 ASL 書寫符號（手語的書面表示），再驅動 Hugo 做出相應的手勢動作。這項技術為聽障人士及其家人提供溝通與教育的管道。Hand Talk 於 2019 年獲選為全球 20 個組織之一，分享 Google.org AI Impact Challenge 的 2500 萬美元獎助金。"
    },
    "highlights": {
      "en": [
        "Translates spoken and written Portuguese into Brazilian Sign Language (Libras) via AI-powered 3D avatar Hugo.",
        "AI pipeline: oral language → ASL gloss → sign animation, enabling natural sign language representation.",
        "Hugo's design features long limbs, large hands, and expressive face to maximize sign language clarity.",
        "Selected in 2019 as one of 20 global organizations to share Google.org's $25M AI Impact Challenge grant.",
        "Supported through Google's Launchpad Accelerator program with consulting and AI coaching."
      ],
      "zh": [
        "透過 AI 驅動的 3D 虛擬角色 Hugo，將葡萄牙語口語和書面語翻譯成巴西手語（Libras）。",
        "AI 流程：口語 → ASL 書寫符號 → 手勢動畫，實現自然的手語表達。",
        "Hugo 具備長手臂、大手掌與豐富表情，以最大化手語的清晰度。",
        "2019 年獲選為全球 20 個組織之一，分享 Google.org AI Impact Challenge 的 2500 萬美元獎助金。",
        "透過 Google Launchpad Accelerator 計畫獲得顧問諮詢與 AI 輔導支援。"
      ]
    },
    "technologies": [
      "Google Cloud",
      "AI (Machine Learning)"
    ],
