    "summary": {
      "en": "Vapi uses Gemini as its intelligence core to power scalable, premium conversational voice AI for developers.",
      "zh": "Vapi 以 Gemini 為核心智慧，讓開發者能以優異的效能建構大規模對話語音 AI，實現每元計算效益最大化。"
    },
    "overview": {
      "en": "Vapi is a developer-first platform for building conversational voice AI agents, using Gemini as its intelligence core to maximize compute-per-dollar efficiency and deliver a premium voice experience at scale. The platform abstracts telephony, audio streaming, and model hosting complexity behind a clean API. In 2025, Vapi raised a $50M Series B (total $72M), reached 1 billion calls served, 1 million developers, and 2.7 million unique agents, with enterprise customers including Amazon Ring and Intuit.",
      "zh": "Vapi 是面向開發者的對話語音 AI 建構平台，以 Gemini 為核心智慧，在大規模部署中實現每元計算效益最大化，同時提供優質語音體驗。平台透過簡潔的 API 抽象化了電話系統、音訊串流及模型託管的複雜性。2025 年，Vapi 完成 5,000 萬美元 B 輪融資（累計 7,200 萬美元），達成 10 億通電話、100 萬名開發者及 270 萬個獨特 AI 代理的里程碑，企業客戶包括 Amazon Ring 與 Intuit。"
    },
