        "Scales for complex AI workloads including RAG pipelines and image search.",
        "Gemini APIs provide large context windows that reduce engineering work and improve RAG query quality.",
        "MongoDB Atlas and Google Cloud enable fast vector search and database queries in a single call.",
        "Cloud Run and Cloud CDN further optimize data transfer between applications and systems."
