      "en": "Wiz, an Israeli cloud security startup, helps security teams deploy AI applications faster and more responsibly. The company created a Vertex AI integration that monitors and manages the security risks associated with running AI models — detecting misconfigurations, sensitive data exposure, data poisoning risks, and identity vulnerabilities behind Vertex AI services. Wiz now integrates with Google Cloud's AI Protection and Vertex AI Agent Engine to detect threats involving AI agents.",
      "zh": "Wiz 是一家以色列雲端安全新創公司，幫助安全團隊更快速、更負責任地部署 AI 應用程式。公司建立了 Vertex AI 整合，監控並管理與運行 AI 模型相關的安全風險——偵測 Vertex AI 服務背後的錯誤配置、敏感資料暴露、資料投毒風險與身份漏洞。Wiz 現已整合 Google Cloud 的 AI Protection 與 Vertex AI Agent Engine，偵測涉及 AI 代理的威脅。"
